lpha.1/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/android-0.1.0-alpha.1/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Featured&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Swipe the cover; Play stays under the thumb.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your installed games, sorted your way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With a controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Phone on its side: full screen, and buttons drive everything.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controllers in dots&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;They light what you press.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The four voices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The sounds Oort makes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No permission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;No network, no files. Nothing is collected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Good to know&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oort contains no game, no key and no engine: the engine is inside each game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A game’s settings and saves stay in its own pause menu: Android keeps those files from Oort.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uninstalling a game happens on its Android page and deletes its saves: export them first.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not there yet: search, vibration, cloud library.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tried in an emulator (Android 10, 14 and 16), with invented games. Not tried: a real phone or tablet, a real nx2android game, a real controller, sound by ear, TalkBack, smoothness and battery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Android 10 or later. The alpha’s signing key is provisional: the final version will have another identifier, and the alpha will have to be uninstalled.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;files&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/android-v0.1.0-alpha.1/Oort-NX-Android-0.1.0-alpha.1.apk&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Android&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-Android-0.1.0-alpha.1.apk · 2.4 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;c07c3b69b779d817da69d35b52f0ac7f40ef7baf1e99e1a2ba4faf94525bfd5f&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.1.0-alpha.1 — Oort leaves the Mac</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/windows-0.1.0-alpha.1/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/windows-0.1.0-alpha.1/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recompilations that come with a recomplauncher.json, and any program with its arguments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start and follow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Play time, the end of a session, a crash explained and the way back to Oort.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With a controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xbox, PlayStation and Nintendo, on-screen keyboard included. The controller’s name shows on the home screen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The cloud and the 27 palettes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The same colors as on the Mac, from 80 to 125%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two-level settings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tried at once, then kept or dropped.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The four voices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The sounds Oort makes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Good to know&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;No game, key or emulator is included, and Oort downloads none. No data is collected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not there yet: copying a game’s files into its folder, mods, key bindings, the Home button in a game, wallpapers, automatic updates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uninstalling leaves your library in place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tried on fresh GitHub machines (Windows Server 2025 and Ubuntu 24.04), with invented games: install, library, settings, launch, coming back, uninstall. Not tried: a player’s PC, a real controller, a real game, Windows 10, a real graphics card, sound by ear.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Windows: the installer is not signed. Compare the checksum, then “More info” and “Run anyway”. It installs for your account, without administrator rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Linux: .deb package for Ubuntu 24.04, Debian 12 and similar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;files&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/windows-v0.1.0-alpha.1/Oort-NX-Windows-0.1.0-alpha.1-x64-setup.exe&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Windows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-Windows-0.1.0-alpha.1-x64-setup.exe · 18 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;5c18776d321721c83181eed7aa330352f244db083a35c55fae01b8d278ede91f&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/windows-v0.1.0-alpha.1/Oort-NX-Linux-0.1.0-alpha.1-x64.deb&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linux&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-Linux-0.1.0-alpha.1-x64.deb · 30 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;f385e0c54c528b6127310115135e63ae2049776d3e1a8d4fd56e7d4a0d209720&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.1.0-alpha.1 — Oort on iPhone and iPad</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/ios-0.1.0-alpha.1/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/ios-0.1.0-alpha.1/</id><updated>2026-11-25T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Featured&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A large cover to swipe, Play under the thumb.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;iPhone on its side&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two panes, and full screen with a controller.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;iPad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tabs at the top, a two-pane game page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controllers in dots&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Try your buttons and set them, for every game or just one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Options per game&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Picture, data, saves, cheats and shortcut.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;No account, nothing is collected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Good to know&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The app loads games compiled as .framework and signed with your Apple account. Oort on Mac cannot make them yet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The part that reads and starts games is adapted from NX2Apple (MIT license). Thanks to its authors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is no game, no key and no engine in the app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Not tried yet&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tried in a simulator (iOS 27.2, iPhone and iPad), with made-up games. Not tried: a real device, signing with AltStore or SideStore, iOS 26, a real game, a real controller, sound, VoiceOver, battery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Install&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;iOS or iPadOS 26 or later. The IPA is not signed: add it with AltStore or SideStore and your Apple account. A free account asks you to sign again every seven days.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;files&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;file&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sofianbll/oort-nx/releases/download/ios-v0.1.0-alpha.1/Oort-NX-iOS-0.1.0-alpha.1-unsigned.ipa&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M12 4v10.500m-4.700-4.200 4.700 4.500 4.700-4.500M5 19.500h14&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;iPhone and iPad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oort-NX-iOS-0.1.0-alpha.1-unsigned.ipa · 7.3 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;sha&quot; data-sha=&quot;61243eae5bfb9d73581e838b805eef30a7858ccae477e7a7663d0d889ce7ad6f&quot; data-done=&quot;Copied&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;8.500&quot; y=&quot;8.500&quot; width=&quot;11&quot; height=&quot;11&quot; rx=&quot;2.500&quot;/&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M15.500 5.500a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copy the checksum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Oort NX 0.3.0 — Arcane becomes Oort NX</title><link href="https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.3.0/"/><id>https://sofianbll.github.io/oort-nx/en/versions/0.3.0/</id><updated>2026-11-23T12:00:00Z</updated><content type="html">&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;New&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Oort theme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dark by default if no theme was chosen, with two icons: Halftone or Particles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot new&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The game display&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose the display your games open on, for all of them or just one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Better&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interrupted transfers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The reason and “Resume” stay visible after the alert.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full disk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The volume is named and the original copy kept.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot better&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A confirmation before an installed app is replaced.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;grp&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fixed&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;chg&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-i=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;dot fixed&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One reason, once&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cloud panel no longer repeats a failure already shown.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;details class=&quot;fold&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Good to know&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;currentColor&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.2&quot; stroke-linecap=&quot;round&quot; stroke-linejoin=&quot;round&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m6 9 6 6 6-6&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recompile Pokémon Legends: Z-A so that the + button goes straight to the game. Choosing the display also needs a game compiled with a compatible engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;</content></entry></feed>